{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 30, :comments ["<b>And you shall put into the breastplate of judgment the Urim and the Tumim.</b> For those who sit in judgment illuminate for the whole world, for this reason the Sanhedrin were called ״עֵינֵי הָעֵדָה״ (Numbers 15:24), for they serve as eyes for them, to bring to light every hidden matter of the litigants, as explained above. Therefore the Urim and the Tumim were placed in the breastplate of judgment."], :book :exodus, :voice :kli-yakar, :lang :en, :chapter 28, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T13:23:59.020111260Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}